nWorking with a Tenant Representative, like me, gives you the confidence of knowing you have full-time real estate professionals helping you find and negotiate for space, as well as advising you every step of the way. All at NO cost to you!\n\nTenant Representatives analyze your alternatives for you, work out all the details of your lease and build in options that benefit you. Until a lease is signed, the Tenant/Landlord relationship is adversarial. The Landlord has his best interest in mind, not yours. You are entitled to representation.\n\nA poorly drawn lease can potentially cripple a business.\n\nTenants lease space only a few times in their business life, while landlords gain experience in the process over and over again. Tenants need the assistance of real estate advisers with the same volume of lease transactions and knowledge to \"level the playing field.\"\n\nA professional Tenant Representative will have in depth knowledge of market conditions, buildings, landlords and other important factors that will impact your lease agreement.\n\nIf you are looking for office space in Long Island, or the surrounding area, please contact us today!','',0,0,0,1000,1,1199,1,1199,1,3499,0,1199,1,2999,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,4999,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(34,61875,0,16164,'Jan','Berg ','CBRE/Hubbell Commercial','6900 Westown Parkway','','West Des Moines','IA','50266','515-221-6680','515-221-6600','','jan.berg@cbre.com','jan.berg@cbre.com','http://www.cbre.com/jan.berg','Central',15,375,'832596000','IA','CCIM,SIOR','','','','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Des-Moines-Office-Space-1280-1041_L.jpg','We haveÂ one of Des Moines\' leading office space and commercial real estate brokersÂ to help meetÂ your needs.Â  With over 15 years of experience including:\n \nDes Moines Office leasing and Sales, Industrial, Land Development, Retail, and Multi-Family\n \n* Office Tenant/Buyer Representation \n* Owner/Seller Representation \n* Land Acquisition/Disposition \n* Build-To-Suit Opportunities \n* Developer/Investor Representation\n \nHer experience in the Des Moines office market and her national contacts provide her with a broader understanding of the Des Moines office space market and potential opportunities with markets outside Des Moines. This knowledge and network provides her the ability to identify and analyze potential development and business opportunities. She utilizes her experience in real estate along with prior interior design experience to expertly analyze the efficiency, usability and quality of office buildings in Des Moines.\n \nShe is known in the business community for using creative thinking and hard work to provide her clients with thorough and competent customer-oriented service. Her continued success in securing and maintaining clients is a direct result of her approach, attention to detail and marketing expertise.\n \nHer mantra... Doing what\'s right in the interest of the Client\n\nIf you are looking for office space in the Des Moines area, please contact her today!','',0,0,0,699,1,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,1,0,0,0,1,0,1,0,1,0,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(35,61876,0,17831,'David','Berglund','Welsh Company','7807 Creekridge Cir','','minneapolis','mn','55349','952-897-7789','952-842-7789','','david.berglund@colliers.com','david.berglund@colliers.com','http://www.welshco.com','Central',18,999,'20486264','mn','CCIM,SIOR','Top 40 under 40 in Minneapolis','Vice President','','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Bloomington-Office-Space-1387-653_L.jpg','We believe in listening first and then responding in ways that respect our clients\' needs.  We are hard working, ethical and solution driven; grounded in tradition but open to new ideas and fresh thinking. \n\nWe know that every real estate project is unique.  So, for every project, we create a unique solution.  We approach each challenge with our trademark entrepreneurial spirit and deep, rich reserve of industry knowledge and experience.  Sound research, technolo