-re.com ','Pacific',6,250,'on file','ca','','','','','','You need to find an office. Who would you rather talk to, an owner of the company? Or a sales person on straight commission?\n\nWhen you talk to an owner like me, you talk to someone who will not just meet your expectations, but will try to exceed them. Someone with a vested interest in building a mutually beneficial relationship with you. Understand this, and you\'ve learned a lot about our company, the way we do business and our innovative Broker Owned business structure.\n\nWe are not looking just to close deals, but to foster and build lasting relationships. That operating philosophy has helped make us the fourth largest commercial real estate sales organization in the country.\n\nThere is certainly no shortage of commercial real estate firms that want your business. That is why we are determined to do things differently - to redefine what a full-service commercial real estate firm should be. Our approach is based on a radically improved business model that is more responsive, client-focused and team-driven.\n\nI have extensive knowledge and experience representing companies and individual investors in making business decisions based on evaluation of their needs and assessment of present conditions inÂ creating alternative real estate solutions. Coupled with a strong background in business finance, e-commerce marketing and client relations, I offer impeccable advantages to my clients.\n\nWe invite you to learn more.\n\n','',0,1,0,1199,1,0,1,0,1,999,1,0,1,0,1,999,1,0,1,0,1,2499,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(73,61911,6475,26131,'Mark','Casey','Tenant Wisdom LLC','3601 Arapahoe Avenue','Suite 303','Boulder','CO','80303','303-665-6000','866-289-5319','303818','mark@tenantwisdom.com','mark@tenantwisdom.com','http://www.TenantWisdom.com','Mountain',12,80,'284721','CO','','','Expert in Industrial Real Estate and Water Rights','We provide guidance in 1031 Exchanges and Self-Directed IRA\'s','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Boulder-Longmont-Office-Space-2429-4805_L.jpg','I am a Commercial Realtor,  representing office space tenants looking for Front Range office and/or warehouse space  to purchase or lease.   \n\n I represent  tenants only - no professional landlords.  Why is that important? Because if dealing directly with the landlord or a broker who represents both landlord and tenants, you are likely not getting the unbiased advice and expertise.\n\nHaving me on your side does not cost you or your company. In fact, on average, we save our clients eight to twelve percent in lower rent and better lease terms. The dollar savings is significant, and equally valuable is the hassle savings achieved through selecting the right space and right landlord.\n\nColorado brokerage law allows us to represent you, the tenant, in the transaction and to be paid by the landlord. Our fee is the standard real estate commission which is already built in to the landlord\'s pricing structure as one of the costs of doing business.\n\nBy using us, you get expert advice and service in determining your facility needs, finding the optimal office space and negotiating the best deal for you, the Tenant.\n\nFrom our headquarters in Boulder, Colorado, our company provides knowledge, expertise and clarity to business tenants throughout the Front Range.\n\nIf you need office space in Boulder, Denver or the Colorado Front Range, contact us today!','We represent tenant and buyers only.',0,0,1,0,1,999,1,999,1,2499,1,499,1,999,0,1499,1,1499,1,1199,1,1499,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(74,61912,6185,10651,'Craig','Castor','Cresa Orlando','221 NE Ivanhoe Blvd','Suite 330','Orlando','FL','32804','407-648-0330 x 16','407-422-1273','407-493-6366','scastor@cresa.com, ccastor@cresa.com','scastor@cresa.com','www.cresapartners.com','Eastern',21,350,'BK 0475680','FL','','','','','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Orlando-Office-Space-1237-382_L.jpg','We pride ourselves on being thorough, making certain our clients see every opportunity that fits their criteria.Â  Our focus remains on the tenant\'s needs throughout the entire process; from first meeting to move in and beyond, making certain there are no loose ends in the client\'s lease process. We have been serving tenants only, in the Orlando office space and Central Florida office and office/service markets for over 20 years.Â \n\nAll of our tenant representation services are paid for by the landlord, but all parties are clear that our fiduciary responsibility is to the tenant, enabling the tenant to get incredible service without paying the fee and, most likely saving thousands of dollars.\n\nOur philosophy is simple - we strive to earn our client\'s confidence in each and every transaction that we do.Â  We look at our role as that of a trusted advisor, not as a commission-based salesperson. Because of this work ethic, we have maintained on-going relations with a vast majority of our clients.\n\nIf you are looking for office space in Orlando, or the surrounding area, please contact us today!','',0,0,0,1199,1,1199,1,1199,1,1399,1,1199,1,0,0,0,0,0,1,0,1,3999,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(75,52351,0,17134,'Christian','Caulum','Oakbrook Corporation','2 Science Court','','Madison','WI','53711','608-443-1040','608-443-1140','608-444-1911','ccaulum@oakbrookcorp.com','ccaulum@oakbrookcorp.com','http://www.oakbrookcorp.com','Central',11,30,'52229-94','WI','CCIM,SIOR','','Degree in Real Estate & Urban Land Economics, UW-Madison','','','Madison, Wisconsin based tenant representation, site selection, negotiation and consulting.  Successful deals on behalf of past clients including Sony, Smith Barney, Safelite, Pitney Bowes, Sub Zero, Wells Fargo Home Mortgage, M3 Insurance, Ryder Truck, and UPS. \n\nIf you are looking for office space in Madison, or the surrounding area, please contact me today!','Madison and south central Wisconsin commercial real estate.',0,0,0,999,1,0,1,1499,1,3499,1,0,1,0,1,999,1,1499,1,1499,