'818-599-6818','tdorn@dornandcompany.com','tdorn@dornandcompany.com','www.dornandcompany.com  www.theleasedoctor.com','Pacific',30,999,'00664155','','','1984 SBA Business of the year','Expert in all facets of leasing commercial real estate','Full service representation, including post lease support.','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Los-Angeles-Airport-Century-Blvd-Office-Space-2341-4780_L.jpg','We negotiate all aspects of the lease for commercial tenants including but not limited to, lease language, operating expense escalations, tenant improvements and rent concessions. We start the process with a comprehensive lease and premises audit. We have a very successful and methodical approach in presenting every potential space listing to the tenant regardless of who represents the landlord. It is virtually impossible for the landlord broker to provide all of these services because of the listings and loyalties they have with the landlord and the contractual obligation they have to get the landlord the very best possible lease terms. Our highly experienced team including legal, space design and construction supports all facets of the commercial space leasing process from start to finish. We support you by staying on as your lease adviser throughout your new lease. \n\nFrom established Fortune 500 Companies to start-ups, We have negotiated over 1,000 leases ranging from 1,000 square feet up to 130,000 square feet including office, retail, industrial and medical and have saved companies as much as $270,000.00 per year. As a pioneer in commercial lease modifications, we have saved business as much as 50% off their current rent plus tenant improvements. \n\nIf you are looking for office space in Los Angeles, or the surrounding areas, please contact us today!','Our sister company, the lease doctor is one of a kind.  We will review and redline any commercial lease document for a flat $395 fee. Please see website at www.theleasedoctor.com',0,0,0,899,1,0,1,0