office space and commercial clients for the past twenty four years. My extensive background in the niche of specializing in tenant negotiations in the Salem area is the cornerstone of my business. My trademark is in representing tenants in the sale, purchase and leasing of office space and commercial and industrial space in the Willamette Valley. \n\nI believe in the importance of building relationships with my clients and take the time to fully understand their needs and desires.  A recent client stated, â€œYou have earned the right to be heard through your caring, thoughtful, no nonsense approach to businessâ€.  My vast experience and knowledge of not only the organizations involved in a transaction, but of the deal-making process, current market trends and issues that can influence each deal, provides me with the necessary qualifications when representing my clients. \n\nAs a local Salem agent aligned with large real estate firm, I have many resources available to me.\n\nWe firmly believe that the only way to stay on top of real estate trends is to combine effort with other commercial specialists. The day to day management of the ever changing costs of owning combined with sales and leasing cycles are now monitored as useful tools for the benefit of our clientâ€™s needs and wants. \n\nToo often selling and leasing are at odds, their perspectives far apart, placing the client at risk. We think that it is the job of the sale/lease agent to help place a client in the best real estate transaction, based on the clientâ€™s goals and comfort level. It is managementâ€™s job to make it perform to those levels and goals. This requires good communication and constant interaction. We believe marketing and knowing your market creates success. If this makes sense to you, contact me today to discuss your needs. \n\nIf you are looking for office space in Salem, or the surrounding area, please contact us today!','',0,0,0,999,1,0,1,0,1,1000,1,1000,1,0,1,1000,0,0,1,0,1,900,1,'2013