resh ideas, diligent service and a smart, alternative approach to finding just the right place for you to hang your shingle.\n\nLocation. Without it, you\'re nowhere.\n\nAffilations\nChattanooga Association of Realtors\nTennessee Association of Realtors\nNational Association of Realtors\nICSC Member\nCCIM Candidate\n\nThe right agent makes a big difference - I can locate hard-to-find properties and negotiate the best possible deal to meet your Chattanooga office space needs. As a top member of the Chattanooga division of our company we have a solid history of providing comprehensive brokerage, leasing, site selection and investment real estate services to our clients.\n\nWe are a full service commercial real estate company. We offer business and investment real estate services.\n\nWe work with buyers, sellers, investors, developers and landlords. Our services include everything from helping you find office space, to listing and marketing your commercial property for sale, to helping you sell or buy an existing business, to full property management services. We have locations in Arkansas, Georgia, Mississippi, and Tennessee specifically tailored to the commercial market. \n\nIf you are looking for office space in Chattanooga, or the surrounding area, please contact us today!','',0,0,0,1399,1,0,1,1999,1,0,1,0,1,0,1,1999,0,0,0,0,1,4999,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(253,39998,0,29902,'James','Jiral','GSC Real Estate','6829 Elm Street','Suite 220','McLean','VA','22101','703-847-7200','703-847-6424','703-956-0479','jim@gscrealestate.com','jim@gscrealestate.com','http://www.gscrealestate.com','Eastern',5,45,'0225098400','VA','','','','','','We are a locally-based brokerage focused on assisting companiesÂ seeking office or retail space in the Tysons Corner, Arlington, Washington DC and surrounding areas.Â  We\'ll put our experience and market knowledge to work for youÂ toÂ locate the best options for your business.\n\nWe built upon sound real estate fundamentals. We take a disciplined approach to every aspect of commercial retail real estate.  Whether it\'s adding key locations, re-positioning within markets, property management or acquisitions we make decisions based on solid demographics, broad experience, and stable resources. We turn commercial real estate assignments into single-minded pursuits of top opportunities for our clients and solid investments for their future growth.   \n\nEach year, we complete dozens of successful transactions â€“ with clients from the gamut of industries. This volume creates market knowledge that allows us to seize opportunities, speed the business process and create the most thorough, precisely accurate picture of local commercial real estate conditions and trends.  Every day, in markets around the DC area, we apply our insight, experience, intelligence and resources to help clients make informed real estate decisions.  \n\nWe do not exist without our clients â€“ and we never lose sight of this fact.  Our mission is to deliver superior results for stakeholders by putting the client first through thinking innovatively and acting decisively.\n\nIf you are looking for office space in Alexandria, or the surrounding area, let us help you. Contact us today!','',0,0,0,499,1,1499,0,0,1,999,0,0,1,1999,1,999,1,1999,1,1999,1,1999,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(254,62056,0,9910,'Alan','Joel','Joel & Granot Real Estate','962 Howell Mill Rd','Suite 100','Atlanta','Ga','30318','404-869-2600','404-869-2601','','alan@joelandgranot.com','alan@joelandgranot.com','www.joelandgranot.com','Eastern',25,400,'118443','Ga','CCIM','2011 Realtor of the Year Award, Phoenix Award - Atlanta Board of Realtors,2005 receiptiant of the Atlanta Commercial Board of Realtor\'s AlvinB Cates award for the most outstanding deal of the year','2010 President of the Atlanta Commercial Board of Realtors','Tenant Representative and Investment Sales','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Alpharetta-Office-Space-400-780_L.jpg','We stay on 