e comprehensive knowledge and experience with years invested in the Tulsa market. Traditionally, real estate transactions are complicated and market data can be overwhelming. Our experience and in-depth market data protects you while helping you reach an informed decision.\n\nWith your needs in mind, we explore the market, evaluate space requirements, examine locations and estimate costs so you can budget appropriately while effectively making your property decision. Choosing a property, whether it\'s office, retail or industrial, is just the beginning. What follows - offers, negotiations and lease/purchase details is where we play a vital role on your behalf.\n\nUltimately, you make the final decision, one reached by having a thorough grasp of the facts and figures. Our service is provided at no cost to our clients. Our fees are paid by the landlord, but only after we find and negotiate a suitable location for you.\n\nOur goal is to assure your ongoing satisfaction in this and any future lease/purchase arrangements with which we are privileged to assist you.\n\nIf you are looking for office space in Tulsa, or the surrounding area, please contact us today!','',0,0,0,1500,1,1500,1,1500,1,1500,1,1499,1,1500,1,1500,1,2000,1,1500,1,4000,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(280,62079,0,13348,'Brad','Kitchen','Alterra Real Estate Advisors','580 S. High Street','Suite 330','Columbus','Oh','43215','614-545-2155','614-280-0244','','bkitchen@alterrare.com','bkitchen@alterrare.com','http://www.alterraRE.com','Eastern',20,999,'390306','Oh','SIOR','Largest Transaction in Columbus, Fast 50, 40 Under 40','Owner of Company, Represent Companies Nationally','Experience, Knowledge Of Best Deals In Market, Time Savings','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Columbus-Office-Space-824-1249_L.jpg','We provide a premier level of commercial real estate brokerage services to companies and individuals throughout the Columbus area, enabling our clients to earn the highest returns on their