 my clients with the best possible service.Â  Ultimately, this means that I can save you time and money in yourÂ next real estate transaction.Â  Engaging a broker with experience will afford you the opportunity to focus on your core business while we do all the work in finding the right property for you and negotiating the terms of the deal.Â  Please keep in mind that in almost every transaction, the Landlord or Seller will pay the commission.Â Â Â The bottom line is thatÂ Â our services result in no direct out of pocket expenses for you.Â We save you money!\n\nIf you are looking for office space in Charlotte, or the surrounding area, please contact us to discuss how we can fulfill your needs.','Charles holds a NC & SC Broker license and the prestigious CCIM designation.  He has been representing tenants for over ten years saving them time and money, often up to twenty and thirty percent in lease cost.  Charles listens to the needs of his clients and provides them with a high level of service and analytical expertise in order to ensure that they get the best deal possible.  Tenants represented have been the small local firms to Fortune 500 corporations.  References will be furnished upon request.',0,0,0,1999,1,0,0,0,1,0,1,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,1,0,1,9999,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(386,62171,0,482,'Jerry','Neitlich','IN/House Corporate Real Estate','2222 Martin St.','Suite 255','Irvine','CA','92612','949-442.0922','949-260.0940','','jerryn@inhousecorp.com','jerryn@inhousecorp.com','www.inhousecorp.com','Pacific',22,300,'01026305','ca','','','','More than just brokering transactions on behalf of the tenant, we are your real estate department at no more cost then you pay your  traditional broker','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Orange-County-Office-Space-545-364_L.jpg','We are a unique real estate firm that understands tenants\' businesses and how real estate can affect their bottom line. Here, tenants can find a guide to sensible and sometimes humorous looks at commercial real estate, how to manage it, and who can help navigate the tricky course through commercial real estate. Independently serving tenant clients since 1992. \n\nIf you have a lease that will terminate in twelve to eighteen months you might as well put a bull\'s eye on your forehead. Every broker within a ninety mile radius has you targeted for cold calls. And every broker has a story. \n\nHow do you separate truth from rumor...fact from fiction? Brokers will claim to have done MORE deals or BIGGER deals. Others claim to know the landlords best so they can get you the best deal while others claim they know the market better than anyone...even the \"secret\" deals. Some provide pictures of buildings they represent trying to entice you to relocate without even knowing anything about your needs. \n\nWhat is so different then about us?Â Â ... \nWe haveÂ built a reputation of offering the best and most complete corporate real estate services exclusively on behalf of the tenants or users. Our client base is built solely on personal referrals...never cold calls...it\'s been that way for over fifteen years. Our clients know we care about them and their business long term...not just during the moment of the real estate transaction. Because of our unique business model we can and do successfully compete against the major regional, national and international firms. IN/House is viewed by our clients\' as their in-house real estate department thus becoming an integral part of our clients\' management team. We help plan, implement and manage all details of their facility needs on an ongoing basis. \n\nNo other commercial real estate firm provides this type or level of service. Addressing real estate matters do not start and stop with a transaction but need to be continually monitored and managed. Unless you are or have a full time real estate person on staff, we are your answer by providing expertise in a complex area which certainly is not your core business. The result is always a great savings of time and money to you and your firm. \n\nIf you are looking for office space in Irvine, or the surrounding area, please contact us today!','Look at ',0,0,0,1999,1,0,1,0,0,3499,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,3499,1,3499,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(387,62172,0,488,'Shelley','Nelbert','Bailes & Associates, Inc.','12121 Wilshire Blvd, #322','','Los Angeles','CA','90025','310-445-4302','310-445-4311','818-516-0520','snelbert@bailesre.com','snelbert@bailesre.com','http://www.bailesrecom','Pacific',20,0,'00869712','ca','','','experienced in working with start up and tech companies','tenant/buyer representation, put together team to assist every facet of move, ','','Our company is a local Los Angeles office space specialized firm. If you need office space for lease or purchase in the greater Los Angeles area, we can impact your bottom line positively.\n\nUtilizing a strategic approach, we help our clients identify their personnel and space requirements, assess their current lease obligations, survey potential sites, negotiate the transaction and manage the process from inception to move-in.\n\nWe use the latest technology for market research and financial analysis, giving our clients the up-to-date and sophisticated information and advice they need to make their real estate related decisions.\n\nAbove all, we only represent office space tenants, not landlords, avoiding the obvious conflict of interest inherit in many real estate companies that represent both, ensuring client impartiality.\n\nUsing detailed questionnaires and in-depth interviews with key people in your organization, we first assist you with defining your office space project to best meet your business goals and objectives. We then establish a schedule. This process will cover, as required:\n\nInventory of leased or owned space, including details of occupancy costs\nCurrent lease obligation\nOwned property assessments\nPersonnel and space requirements\nRenew lease or wait\nLease or purchase\nDemographics of target markets\nFinancial impact of employees of non-reimbursed move or commuting expenses\nTax consequences\nTransportation\nAmenities and services\nSpace disposition\n\nContact us today if you need to purchase or lease office space in Los Angeles of the surrounding office markets.\n','You can find out more about me on linked in.',0,0,0,749,1,0,0,0,1,1999,1,0,1,0,0,0,0,0,1,1499,1,1700,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(388,28689,0,3245,'Lee','Nelsen','Fishman Realty Group','470 Forest Ave, Suite 302','','Portland','ME','04101','207-775-6561, ext 2114','207-871-0914','','lee@fishmanrealty.com','lee@fishmanrealty.com','http://www.fishmanrealty.com','Eastern',30,200,'on file','ME','','','30+ years leasing, sales and management experience','extensive market knowledge and contacts','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Portland-Office-Space-726-1218_L.jpg','We maintain a comprehensive list of available commercial properties for sale and for lease throughout Maine and New Hampshire.Â  Our brokers are experienced in all phases of brokerage and our markets, so we get deals done efficiently.Â  We also manage properties and have a residential rental department that is very helpful for companies that relocate personnel.Â  We are your one-stop agency for all real estate needs.Â \n\nIf you are looking for office space in Portland, Maine, or the surrounding area, please contact us today!','We are a full service commercial brokerage and management company.',0,0,0,350,1,350,1,500,1,0,1,0,1,500,1,500,1,500,1,500,1,500,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(389,62173,0,4175,'Michael','Nelson','CB Richard Ellis, Inc.','177 Broad Street','Suite 700','Stamford','CT','06901','203 352-8991','203 352-8998','203 722-8184','michael.nelson@cbre.com','michael.nelson@cbre.com',' www.cbre.com ','Eastern',4,40,'342700','NY','','CBRE Associate Broker of the year on 2005','MBA in Finance','','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Danbury-Office-Space-1612-4803_L.jpg',