e, flex or high tech buildings or vacant land to build a facility. In addition, we will negotiate the best contract terms, without the usual landlord-broker conflict of interest. We only represent you. The landlord / seller pays our fee! There is no cost to you, only savings.\n \nWe provide the following additional related services: Occupancy Analysis, Market Research, Legal Negotiation, Facility Measurement, Space Planning, Move Management, Expense Escalation Audits, Lease Administration and Property Disposition.\n\nIf you are looking for office space in Detroit, or the surrounding area, please contact us today!','Exclusively Representing Tenants/Buyers',0,0,1,0,1,1499,1,1499,1,1999,1,599,1,1499,0,0,0,0,1,2999,1,3499,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(499,62260,0,4344,'Ray','Smith','The Realty Brokerage, Inc.','1411 Highway 35','','Ocean','NJ','07712-3525','908-517-0100','908-517-0010','','Ray@ssrealty.com','Ray@ssrealty.com','http://ssrealty.com/, http://rayssmith.com/','Eastern',20,500,'co-8300337','nj','','','','','http://www.officefinder.com/images/Tenant-Rep-Photos/Office-Space-630-1316_L.jpg','The experience of the professionals at Stafford my firm in leasing industrial buildings, office buildings and shopping centers has been extensive throughout New Jersey. Many Fortune 500 companies have successfully located facilities through us. Assisting the individual professional right through to the large corporation, no customer is too small or too large to be accommodated.\n\nWhen representing the landlord in leasing their property, our professionals strive to locate top quality, financially sound tenants by locating national chains for retail centers; high-tech and defense contractors for office buildings; and expanding manufacturing firms for industrial facilities.\n\nWe are a staff of seasoned professionals who look out for the best interest of the clients we represent. Many of our sales associates have a background in construction enabling them to intelligently discuss 