1305716','CA','','','','','','Solid Foundation\nOur Company was founded on two basic tenets, sound advice and successful negotiations. After years of experience in the tenant representation industry, and countless real estate transactions, we have found that these two principles are the foundations and primary reasons that our clients come back to us time-and-time again for their real estate solutions.\n\nValue and Strength\nTrue value in the commercial real estate industry comes in the form of professionals who can clearly understand client needs while also understanding the business needs of the other parties involved in a real estate negotiation. The strength that our company brings to each and every client is the deep knowledge of landlordsâ€™ business practices and financial bottom lines. Using this knowledge, our brokers then advise their clients in devising a negotiating strategy which will yield effective and money-smart real estate solutions. The power of knowledge, in this case the knowledge of how a real estate negotiation really works on both sides of the table, is what is utilized to provide our clients with comprehensive and well-crafted negotiations.\n\nTrusted Advisor\nEveryone knows that solid client relationships keep clients coming back, and in a highly competitive industry such as tenant representation, it is rare when a brokerage firm can attest to a client roster that is more repeat business than not. Our company is proud of our track record of repeat and referral-based business. This reputation has been assiduously built on trust, and client-centric flexibility, and is backed up by consistent and quantifiable client success.\n\n\nIf you are looking for office space in Los Angeles, or the surrounding areas, please contact us today!','',0,0,0,1999,1,1999,1,1999,1,1999,1,0,1,1999,1,1999,0,0,0,0,1,19999,1,'2013-08-21 19:24:16'),(561,0,0,27,'Janine','Watson','Grubb & Ellis Commercial Brokerage','One Bush Street, Suite 800','','San Francisco','CA','